===Etymology===
{{etymon|gu|id=fruit|inh|pra>𑀨𑀮>fruit|tree=1}}
{{inh+|gu|inc-ogu|फल}}, from {{inh|gu|pra-sau|𑀨𑀮}}, from {{inh|gu|sa|फल|tr=phála}}, ultimately from {{der|gu|dra-pro|*paẓam|t=ripe fruit}}. {{dbt|gu|ફલ}}. Cognate with {{cog|hi, ne|फल}} and {{cog|mr, mwr|फळ}}.

